# ESP-IDF build output. One tree per target, each a few hundred megabytes, all reproducible from
# the sources beside them.
build_*/
sdkconfig.esp32*
sdkconfig.old

# Captured serial output. Kept out of the tree by default: a capture is a measurement of one board
# on one day, and committing it invites reading a stale number as the current one. Check in a
# specific capture deliberately with `git add -f` when it is being cited.
results/
